graph TD
    A[Request Received] --> B{Complexity Level}
    B -->|Low < 5| C[Auto Approval]
    B -->|Medium 5-8| D[User Review Required]
    B -->|High > 8| E[Expert Review Required]
    C --> F[Execute Operation]
    D --> G{User Approves?}
    E --> H{Expert Approves?}
    G -->|Yes| F
    G -->|No| I[Request Denied]
    H -->|Yes| F
    H -->|No| I
    F --> J[Log AC_START]
    J --> K[Execute with CORE Rules]
    K --> L[Log AC_COMPLETE]
    L --> M[Return Result]
    I --> N[Return Error]
    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style F fill:#c8e6c9
    style I fill:#ffcdd2
    style M fill:#c8e6c9
    style N fill:#ffcdd2